<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CVRD base price due March 5.</title>
<headline>Brazil CVRD base price due March 5.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The bid specifications and minimum price for Brazilian mining giant Companhia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD) will be revealed next Wednesday, the Planning Ministry said.</p>
<p>A ministry spokeswoman said the tender details and base price for an initial block sale of 40-45 percent of voting shares, due to take place in April, would be published after a meeting of the National Privatization Council (CND).</p>
<p>Officials had previously said tender details might be made public Friday.</p>
<p>((-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358))</p>
